      "writtenOn": "2026-08-08T00:47:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Iterating the enum guarantees the actions run in a pre-set order irrespective of the order the caller passes them in, so I\u0027ve kept the loop as-is and documented that contract on Action instead.",
